        "desc": "Where downloads go: a folder inside one of your shared folders. The package makes the last folder (<b>MeTube</b> here) if it may write in the shared folder, but never makes a shared folder itself — create a <b>Downloads</b> shared folder first in Control Panel → Shared Folder if you don't have one. If the package's user isn't allowed to write there, the MeTube window shows exactly what to tick. It can be changed later in the window (Defaults).",
